# oracle: superellipsoid bowling (in.bowling as shipped): 10 pins (shape 1 1 4, block 8 2, mass 1) and a ball (shape 2 2 1, block 2 2, mass 10 set after its shape); the ball rolls in with angmom and vy 7 and hits the pins within 100 steps; hooke + mass_velocity, per-atom positions, velocities, forces, torques and angular momenta
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box), max relative error of the engine vs native: thermo (ke) within 1e-8 (harness),
# positions 9e-9, velocities 9e-8, angular momenta 1.3e-7, orientations 6e-8, forces and torques up to 1.0e-5 (both on the
# two atoms of the pin 6 - pin 10 contact at step 100, a contact between block-8 superquadrics). The static contacts of these
# shapes agree with native to 1e-14, so the cause is in the dynamic history of the contacts, not isolated here. Per-step
# forces agree exactly until step 37, 3e-8 at the first ball-pin contact (step 38), 1e-7 by step 43.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=2e-7 abs=1e-10
# oracle-files: oracle_sf.dump
units           si
atom_style      ellipsoid superellipsoid
dimension       3
boundary p p p
comm_modify vel yes
newton off

region          box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box      2 box

# Pins
create_atoms 1 single 5 5 5

create_atoms 1 single 4 6 5
create_atoms 1 single 6 6 5

create_atoms 1 single 3 7 5
create_atoms 1 single 5 7 5
create_atoms 1 single 7 7 5

create_atoms 1 single 2 8 5
create_atoms 1 single 4 8 5
create_atoms 1 single 6 8 5
create_atoms 1 single 8 8 5

set             type 1 shape 1.0 1.0 4.0
set             type 1 block 8.0 2.0
set             type 1 mass 1.0

# Bowling ellipsoids
create_atoms 2 single 5.5 1.5 6
set             type 2 shape 2.0 2.0 1.0
set             type 2 block 2.0 2.0
set             type 2 mass 10.0
group ball type 2

pair_style      granular/superellipsoid
pair_coeff      * * hooke 1000.0 0.0 tangential linear_history 285 0.0 0.5 damping mass_velocity

compute diameter all property/atom shapex shapey shapez
compute orient all property/atom quatw quati quatj quatk
compute block all property/atom block1 block2

set group ball angmom 1.0 0.0 0.5 vy 7.0

fix 3 all nve/asphere

thermo 10
thermo_style custom step pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g
timestep 0.01
run             100
write_dump all custom oracle_sf.dump id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz tqx tqy tqz angmomx angmomy angmomz c_orient[*] c_block[*] modify format float %.15g sort id
